 - 2026-06-14: Archive .387 -> activate .388; KEEP the hardened green-gate + poison-test quarantine. Assert research-complete.yaml + ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml parse under yaml.safe_load; run the smart-subset pre-test gate green; RECORD the .387 close-state (verifier moat PROVEN-headroom-present on code, exp4177 verifier_value_added=true delta +0.18 CI95[0.08,0.30] but efficiency_parity=false; GAP-3 Stage-1 BOUNDED exp4178; DiffusionGemma gate MET; ARC total_levels_solved=14/total_games_solved=13). (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: archived_v387_v388_active_moat_PROVEN_headroom_present_code_delta_0.18_efficiency_unwon_gap3_BOUNDED_diffusiongemma_MET_arc_levels14_games13; results/experiment_4184_archive_v387_activate_v388.json
 - 2026-06-14: PHASE A1 — Headroom re-census + LLM-as-judge baseline harness + REAL cost meter. Reuse scripts/headroom_gate.py to re-establish the executable-headroom domain(s) (code proven 0.18; attempt a 2nd executable pool — MBPP/EvalPlus or held-out Sudoku — generating candidates from a SOTA GGUF behind a PRECONDITIONS cache check if none cached). BUILD the LLM-as-judge arm (a SOTA GGUF prompts a best-candidate selection) with per-call wall-clock + token instrumentation; SMOKE it on >=3 real candidates. Emit max_selectable_headroom (BARE) + llm_judge_ready + the cost meter. The comparator + positive control A2 requires. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: headroom_recensus_llm_judge_ready_domain_code_max_selectable_headroom_0.1800; results/experiment_4185_headroom_recensus_llm_judge_harness.json
 - 2026-06-14: PHASE A2 (DECISIVE, gated_on A1 headroom>=0.10) — the EFFICIENCY moat: Carnot executable/energy verifier + V-STaR selector (ARM A) vs LLM-as-judge (ARM J) vs SC-vote (ARM B) vs oracle, on the headroom-present executable domain. Report accuracy parity (bootstrap CI95 on pass@1(A)-pass@1(J)) AND the REAL cost ratio (verifier wall-clock/tokens / judge wall-clock/tokens). verifier_efficiency_win := A within-CI of J on accuracy AND >=10x cheaper (or strict Pareto-dominance). Resolves the north-star §5 efficiency-parity question with REAL cost (fixes the .387 abstract-cost-unit caveat). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: verifier_efficiency_win_true_delta_0.1800; results/experiment_4186_efficiency_moat_verifier_vs_llm_judge.json
+- 2026-06-14: PHASE B1 — GAP-4 graded execution-energy gate (production-safe). Implement+validate the graded min-hamming gate (tau=0.005 ONLY + a vote-aware guard blocking the measured exact-match mis-promotion over high-vote gold, the 25094a63 case) on the non-degenerate ARC-1 venue. The agreement signal STAYS a confidence label only (exp4023 retired agreement-as-selector). Report pass@1/pass@2 vs vote, the gross +/- ledger, and band precision at tau<=0.02. Makes the proven +4/-0 GAP-4 verifier safe for a richer candidate pool. READ-ONLY w.r.t. TRM training. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: gap4_graded_relaxation_adds_nothing_on_arc1_holds_exact_baseline_n31_vote_0.4516_graded_0.5806_recovered_4_lost_0_guarded_25094a63; results/experiment_4187_gap4_graded_execution_gate_hardening.json
